I have not given them all, because they are not all at work in the field. If my hon. friend would like to have the list, with the salaries paid, I will give it :	The acting director, Dr. Bell, $3,500 ;
Dr. Whiteaves, $2,600 ; Dr. Hoffmann, $2,600 ; Professor Macoun, $2,450 ; Dr. Ells, $2,350 ; Hugh Fletcher, $2,350 ; R. G. McConnell, $2,350 ; E. D. Ingall, $2,100 ; A. B. Low, $2,050 ; L. N. Lambe. $1,900 ; Robert Chalmers, $1,900 ; William Mclnnes, $1,900 ; H. M. Ami, $1,900 ; E. R. Faribault, $1,900 ; A. E. Barlow, $1,850 ; J. M. Macoun, $1,800 ; F. G. Wait, $1,750 ; D. B. Dowling. $1,700 ; C. O. Senecal, $1,700 ; R. A. A. Johnston,

$1,600 ; R. W. Brock. $1,400 ; W. J. Wilson, $1,250 ; Theophile Dennis. $1,250 ; Joseph Keele, $1,550 ; two vacancies, one at $1,150 and the other at $1,100 ; John Marshall, $2,000 ; C. W. Willimott, $1,500 ; R. L. Broadbent. $1,500 ; L. N. Richard. $1,250 ; A. T. McKinnon, $S50 ; J. A. McGee. $825 ; John Thorburn, $800 ; and J. F. Lyons. $800.
